    "detailed_description": "This is our work-in-progress shooter game which we aim to flesh out over the coming months - what is seen here is not representative of the final product.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSet on a space base on a distant planet, your goal is to take control of the station.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere will be multiple game modes and maps allowing for more fun and variety (only one map and game mode currently present).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a third-person shooter game where your aim is to take back control. We currently only have a &quot;Kill-em-All&quot; style game mode in which your only goal is to survive and to kill all enemies on the station.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWill you run and avoid them? Or will you face them head-on!",
